  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nAccording to the question,\n\n \n \n\n \n \n**Symbol**\n\n \n \n \n**N**\n\n \n \n \n**T**\n\n \n \n \n**M**\n\n \n \n \n**A**\n\n \n **R**\n \n \n\n \n \n**Meaning**\n\n \n \n \n**×**\n\n \n \n \n**-**\n\n \n \n \n**÷**\n\n \n \n \n**=**\n\n \n **+**\n \n \n\nSo,\n\n1) 36M18N36R18T36A58 \n\n⇒ __**36 **____**÷ **____**18**__ × 36 + 18 - 36 = 58\n\n⇒ __**2 **____**× **____**36**__ + 18 - 36 = 58\n\n⇒ __**72 **____**+ **____**18**__ - 36 = 58 \n\n⇒ __**90 - 36**__ = 58\n\n⇒ 54 ≠ 58 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n2) 36M18N36R18T36A54\n\n⇒ __36 ____÷ ____18__ × 36 + 18 - 36 = 54\n\n⇒ __2 ____× ____36__ + 18 - 36 = 54\n\n⇒ __72 ____+ ____18__ - 36 = 54\n\n⇒ __90 - 36__ = 54\n\n⇒ 54 = 54 (LHS = RHS)\n\n3) 36N18R36M18T36A54\n\n⇒ 36 ×** **18 + __36 ____÷ 18__ - 36 = 54\n\n⇒ __**36 ×**____** **____**18**__ + 2 - 36 = 54\n\n⇒ __**648 + 2**__ - 36 = 54\n\n⇒ __**650 - 36**__ = 54\n\n⇒ 614 ≠ 54 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n4) 36A18T36N18R36M54\n\n⇒ 36 = 18 - 36 × 18 + __**36 **____**÷ 54__**\n\n⇒ 36 = 18 - __**36 × 18**__ + 0.67\n\n⇒ 36 = 18 - __**648 + 0.67**__\n\n⇒ 36 = __**18 - 647.33**__\n\n⇒ 36 ≠ - 629.33 ( LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option - (2)\"** is the correct answer.",
